+# Local Copilot usage board
+
+Version0.1.1 targets DSH0.2.1-rc.2. Keeps the existing quota/token aggregation and sidebar display; credentials and account state remain Host-owned.
+
+Changes: require the Host Connection authentication/same-origin check in addition to loopback restriction, exact GET/POST methods, and cap diagnostic request bytes before buffering (16KiB, rendered log text remains4000 characters). Routes are removed on disposal. These guards do not grant remote access or change quota/pricing data.
+
+`node --test test/*.test.mjs` validates rejection before network access, method guards and diagnostic bounds. Full sidebar assembly is checked separately with a synthetic loopback quota endpoint and synthetic key; no account credentials are required for that test.
+
+Install a pinned tarball and verify installed version/content. Source updates through a live link can reload the plugin: update only in the coordinated maintenance window. Preserve the existing gateway, account credential reference and usage state; do not publish their values.
